      "side": 1,
      "message": "in \u0027main\u0027, you might be able to change users with exec (or system as an alternative). Though, you might have a hard time finding UIDs to work as alternatives:\n\n    if (getuid() !....) return execl( ... su ... argv .... );\n    \n    \nOr you could use apps for these test cases. Why is it that different UIDs matter here?",
